  "title": "Bank OZK Announces Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025 Earnings",
  "summary": "LITTLE ROCK, Ark. , Jan. 20, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Bank OZK (the “Bank”) (Nasdaq: OZK) today announced that net income available to common stockholders for the fourth quarter of 2025 was $171.9 million , a 3.5% decrease from $178.1 million for the fourth quarter of 2024.",
